  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A boss: base monster in the monster category, large (scale 1.5), with knockback resistance 1 and fire immunity. It shoots snowballs at players from up to 24 blocks (msm:ranged_attack) and hits for 12 damage when close (msm:attack); melee_attack comes first in the goals, so it closes in when it can reach the player and shoots when it cannot. msm:boss_bar shows its health in a blue bar (10 notches) and darkens the sky for players nearby; a boss never despawns and is seen from ten chunks away. It never spawns on its own: summon it with its spawn egg or /summon. msm:animated_model names the model, animation set and texture with renderer auto: GeckoLib draws it where the target has GeckoLib, the runtime's own renderer elsewhere. Export the Fabric mod jar to try it in game.",
